WEBVTT

1
00:00:22.192 --> 00:00:23.642
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Morning, Mr Fischer.

2
00:00:23.826 --> 00:00:32.482
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi… I… Hi… Hello. Good morning.

3
00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.398
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Is this your local coffee shop?

4
00:00:38.973 --> 00:00:42.519
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah. My school is really near here.

5
00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.603
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Oh yes, Tensquare School.

6
00:00:46.225 --> 00:00:47.100
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah.

7
00:00:50.414 --> 00:00:51.658
Do you know it?

8
00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:54.650
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah, I do.

9
00:00:57.228 --> 00:01:00.290
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> What would you like, Izzy? Your usual?

10
00:01:01.211 --> 00:01:01.948
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Izzy.

11
00:01:03.053 --> 00:01:06.368
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes, please. How are you, Carla?

12
00:01:06.598 --> 00:01:08.221
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> I’m good. And you?

13
00:01:08.578 --> 00:01:09.234
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’m OK.

14
00:01:09.613 --> 00:01:10.626
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> How’s the job?

15
00:01:11.064 --> 00:01:14.125
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Good! It’s long hours, but I like it.

16
00:01:15.484 --> 00:01:18.373
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Uh… are you two friends?

17
00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:24.887
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah. I come here a lot. I live very near here.

18
00:01:26.556 --> 00:01:27.477
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Really?

19
00:01:29.802 --> 00:01:31.091
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah. How’s the course?

20
00:01:32.242 --> 00:01:37.974
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Good, but…it’s really hard work.

21
00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:41.520
I don’t like the teacher very much.

22
00:01:42.003 --> 00:01:42.947
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Andre…

23
00:01:44.351 --> 00:01:45.548
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Do you know him?

24
00:01:46.124 --> 00:01:50.682
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah. He’s… difficult.

25
00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.880
Nice to see you again, Mr Fischer.

26
00:02:08.453 --> 00:02:15.751
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Izzy? Um… Oh, sorry.

27
00:02:16.004 --> 00:02:23.555
Erm, I… um… Do you…

28
00:02:24.153 --> 00:02:27.560
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Do you want to go out sometime?

29
00:02:27.675 --> 00:02:28.435
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Me?

30
00:02:29.678 --> 00:02:30.599
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> You.

31
00:02:35.318 --> 00:02:36.239
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah.

32
00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:38.978
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> OK.

33
00:02:41.418 --> 00:02:43.030
Here’s my number.

34
00:02:51.778 --> 00:02:53.435
Call me.

35
00:03:14.107 --> 00:03:15.719
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Have a biscuit.